I think I have seen this thread some times ago, but please someone
enlighten me...

I recently came back from honeymoon from Bali, Indonesia ( ;-)  What a
gorgeous island...)  During my stay, I had a chance to witness many of its
famous Bali-dances, and I happened to notice one of them was called "Kris
Dance"  The dance features Bali dancers who are "in trance" lunging knives
called "Krisknife" at themselves.  I was just wondering whether the
crysknife in nethack has its origin from Bali's "Krisknife" or from some
Hindu culture.

If it is, I have to doubt the crysknife being one of the most potent
weapons in the world of nethack.  Those dancers looked OK after all those
lunges (although they looked pretty fake to me ;-)
 
FYI, the "Krisknife" basically looks like this;

	||
	||
       ----
	\\
	//
	\\
	//
	\\
	//

Any confirmations?


